cess for %2$s is ENABLED, regardless of role capabilities.'=>'%1$s iraye si fun %2$s ti wa ni ṢÍṢÉ, laibikita awọn agbara ipa.','%1$s access for %2$s is BLOCKED, unless enabled by another Permission.'=>'%1$s iraye si fun %2$s ti wa ni DÍMÚ, ayafi ti a ba mu ṣiṣẹ́ nípa Àṣẹ mìíràn.','Any role-based %1$s access for %2$s is LIMITED. It applies to only %3$s, along with other specified %4$s.'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe %1$s ti o da lori ipa fun %2$s jẹ IYỌRỌ. O ṣiṣẹ nikan fun %3$s, pẹlu awọn %4$s miiran ti a sọ.','Assigned for sub-%s only.'=>'Ti yan fun sub-%s nikan.','Assigned for %s and sub-%s.'=>'Ti yan fun %s àti sub-%s.','This Permission is redundant due to a corresponding Limitation.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii jẹ alaimuṣinṣin nitori ihamọ ti o baamu.','Edit %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','Assign for selected and sub-%s'=>'Yàn fun ti a yan ati sub-%s','Assign for selected %s only'=>'Yàn fun ti a yan %s nikan','Assign for sub-%s only'=>'Yàn fun sub-%s nikan','Assign for selected and sub-terms'=>'Yàn fun ti a yan ati sub-ọrọ','Assign for selected term only'=>'Yàn fun ọrọ ti a yan nikan','Assign for sub-terms only'=>'Yàn fun sub-ọrọ nikan','Convert to "Enabled"'=>'Yipada si "Ti mu ṣiṣẹ"','Convert to "Blocked"'=>'Yipada si "Ti dani"','Convert to "Limit to"'=>'Yipada si "Ihamọ si"','Mirror to %s'=>'Mirọ si %s','Mirror to %s %s'=>'Mirọ si %s %s','= Enabled'=>'= Ti mu ṣiṣẹ','= Blocked'=>'= Ti dani','= Limitation'=>'= Ihamọ','= %1$s and sub-%1$s'=>'= %1$s ati sub-%1$s','= sub-%s only'=>'= sub-%s nikan','Note:'=>'Ak note:','Sub-%1$s Permissions are not separately listed.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ Sub-%1$s ko ti wa ni atokọ ni oriṣiriṣi.','Show All'=>'Fihan Gbogbo','Hide auto-assigned Sub-%s Permissions'=>'Pa Sub-%s Aṣẹ ti a fiwe si laifọwọyi','Other plugins (or deactivation of PublishPress Permissions) can prevent sub-page permissions from being properly applied when a new sub-page is created.'=>'Awọn afikun miiran (tabi ifagile ti Aṣẹ PublishPress) le ṣe idiwọ fun awọn aṣẹ sub-page lati jẹ ti a lo ni deede nigbati a ṣẹda sub-pag