ame (A-Z)'=>'Orukọ (A-Z)','Name (Z-A)'=>'Orukọ (Z-A)','Most Users'=>'Ọpọlọpọ Awọn olumulo','Fewest Users'=>'Ẹniti o kere ju Awọn olumulo','Select All'=>'Yan Gbogbo','Bulk Actions'=>'Iṣẹ Aṣa','Set to Enabled'=>'Ṣeto si Mú ṣiṣẹ','Set to Blocked'=>'Ṣeto si Ipa','Set to Default'=>'Ṣeto si Aiyipada','selected'=>'yiyan','Search and add users...'=>'Wa ki o si fi awọn olumulo kun...','No role exceptions set'=>'Ko si iyasọtọ ipa ti a ṣeto','No specific user permissions. Use the search box to add users.'=>'Ko si awọn igbanilaaye olumulo pato. Lo apoti wiwa lati fi awọn olumulo kun.','Remove Selected'=>'Yọ Yiyan','Login State'=>'Ipo Iwọle','Sub-Sections'=>'Ipin-kekere','This Section'=>'Ipin yii','Remove custom permissions for user'=>'Yọ awọn ẹtọ aṣa fun olumulo','PublishPress Permissions needs directions. Please go to %1$sPermissions > Settings%2$s and indicate which Post Types and Taxonomies should be filtered.'=>'Awọn ẹtọ PublishPress nilo itọsọna. Jọwọ lọ si %1$sAwọn ẹtọ > Eto%2$s ki o tọka iru Awọn Iru Ifiweranṣẹ ati Awọn Taxonomies ti o yẹ ki a ṣe àlẹmọ.','Please upgrade PublishPress Authors to version 3.8.0 or later for Permissions integration.'=>'Jọwọ mu PublishPress Authors ṣiṣẹ si ẹya 3.8.0 tabi ti o ga julọ fun iṣọpọ Awọn ẹtọ.','Editing can\'t be granted to non-users.'=>'A ko le fun ni igbanilaaye ṣiṣatunkọ si awọn ti kii ṣe awọn olumulo.','You can now set individual permissions for'=>'O le bayi ṣeto awọn ẹtọ ẹni kọọkan fun','All'=>'Gbogbo','Default'=>'Aiyipada','Please select a bulk action first.'=>'Jọwọ yan iṣe apapọ akọkọ.','Please select at least one item.'=>'Jọwọ yan o kere ju ohun kan.','Are you sure you want to remove the selected user(s) from exceptions?'=>'Ṣe o da lori pe o fẹ yọ awọn olumulo ti a yan kuro ninu awọn ẹtọ?','Remove the custom permisisons for "%s"?'=>'Yọ awọn ẹtọ aṣa fun "%s"?','Permissions Settings'=>'Eto Awọn igbanilaaye','Permissions: %s'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye: %s','Permissions: Select this %s as Parent'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye: Yan %s yii gẹgẹbi Baba','Permissions: Assign Terms to this %s'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye: Pin Awọn Ẹka si %s yii','Permissions: %s this %s'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye: %s yii %s','enable custom permissions for %s'=>'ṣe ẹtọ aṣa fun %s','Select as Parent'=>'Yan gẹgẹ bi Baba','Assign Terms'=>'Yàn Awọn Ọrọ','Specific Permissions %1$s(for this user)%2$s'=>'Ẹtọ Pataki %1$s(fun olumulo yii)%2$s','Extra Roles %1$s(from primary role or group membership)%2$s'=>'Ipa afikun %1$s(lati ipa akọkọ tabi ẹgbẹ membership)%2$s','Specific Permissions (from primary role or group membership)'=>'Ẹtọ Pataki (lati ipa akọkọ tabi ẹgbẹ membership)','Permission Groups'=>'Ẹgbẹ Ẹtọ','This user is not a member of any custom Permission Groups.'=>'Olumulo yii kii ṣe ọmọ ẹgbẹ eyikeyi Ẹgbẹ Ẹtọ aṣa.','Edit this user\'s group membership'=>'Ṣatunkọ membership ẹgbẹ olumulo yii','Note: BuddyPress Groups and other externally defined groups are not listed here, even if they modify permissions'=>'Akiyesi: Awọn ẹgbẹ BuddyPress ati awọn ẹgbẹ ti a ṣalaye ni ita ko si nibi, paapaa ti wọn ba yi awọn ẹtọ pada','%s, more...'=>'%s, siwaju...','edit user permissions'=>'ṣatunkọ awọn ẹtọ olumulo','Assign to %s'=>'Yàn si %s','Assign (All Types)'=>'Yàn (Gbogbo Awọn Iru)','%s (All Types)'=>'%s (Gbogbo Iru)','Permissions: %1$s in %2$s'=>'Awọn ẹtọ: %1$s ni %2$s','Displayed permissions are those assigned for the "%1$s" type. You can also %2$sdefine universal %3$s permissions which apply to all related post types%4$s.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a han ni awọn ti a yàn fun iru "%1$s". O tun le %2$sṣe alaye awọn aṣẹ agbaye %3$s ti o kan gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o jọmọ%4$s.','Permissions: Assign this %2$s to %3$s'=>'Awọn ẹtọ: Yàn %2$s yii si %3$s','Permissions: Assign this %2$s for All Post Types'=>'Awọn ẹtọ: Yàn %2$s yii fun Gbogbo Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','Permissions: %1$s %2$s in this %3$s'=>'Awọn ẹtọ: %1$s %2$s ninu %3$s yii','Permissions: %1$s all content in this %2$s for All Post Types'=>'Awọn ẹtọ: %1$s gbogbo akoonu ninu %2$s yii fun Gbogbo Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','Permissions: %1$s this %2$s'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́: %1$s yi %2$s','Displayed permissions are those assigned for the "%1$s" type.%2$sYou can also %3$sdefine universal %4$s permissions which apply to all related post types%5$s.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a han ni awọn ti a yàn fun iru "%1$s".%2$sO tun le %3$sṣe alaye awọn aṣẹ agbaye %4$s ti o kan gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o jọmọ%5$s.','Listed permissions are those assigned for the "%1$s" type. You can also %2$sdefine universal %3$s permissions which apply to all related post types%4$s.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a ṣe akojọ ni awọn ti a yàn fun iru "%1$s". O tun le %2$sṣe alaye awọn aṣẹ agbaye %3$s ti o kan gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o jọmọ%4$s.','Click to list/edit universal permissions'=>'Tẹ lati ṣe akojọ/edit ẹ̀tọ́ àgbáyé','%1$s Permissions %2$s*%3$s'=>'%1$s Ẹ̀tọ́ %2$s*%3$s','Universal Permissions'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Àgbáyé','Permissions&hellip;'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́&hellip;','Add'=>'Fikun','Add selected users to Permission Group'=>'Fikun àwọn olumulo tí a ti yan si Ẹgbẹ Ẹ̀tọ́','Remove selected users from Permission Group'=>'Yọ àwọn olumulo tí a ti yan kuro ni Ẹgbẹ Ẹ̀tọ́','Click to show only users who have no group'=>'Tẹ lati fi hàn àwọn olumulo tó ni ẹgbẹ́ kankan','Click to show only users who have extra roles'=>'Tẹ lati fi hàn àwọn olumulo tó ni àwọn ipa afikun','Click to show only users who have Specific Permissions assigned directly'=>'Tẹ lati fi hàn àwọn olumulo tó ni Ẹ̀tọ́ Pataki tí a yàn taara','Specific Permissions'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Pataki','edit group'=>'ṣatunkọ ẹgbẹ́','%s more'=>'%s diẹ sii','Group created.'=>'Ẹgbẹ́ ti dá.','Create New Permission Group'=>'Ṣẹda Ẹgbẹ Ẹ̀tọ́ Tuntun','Create New %s'=>'Ṣẹda Tuntun %s','Name'=>'Orukọ','Description'=>'Apejuwe','Note: Groups are a more flexible alternative to user roles. You can create groups of users and give or deny them access to areas of your site.'=>'Akíyèsí: Awọn ẹgbẹ jẹ aṣayan ti o ni irọrun diẹ sii si awọn ipa olumulo. O le ṣẹda awọn ẹgbẹ ti awọn olumulo ki o si fun wọn ni iraye si tabi kọ wọn ni iraye si awọn agbegbe ti aaye rẹ.','Create Group'=>'Ṣẹda Ẹgbẹ','Shop manager'=>'Oludari ile itaja','Translator'=>'Onitumo','Customer'=>'Onibara','You have specified this group for deletion:'=>'O ti yan ẹgbẹ yii fun piparẹ:','There are no valid groups selected for deletion.'=>'Ko si awọn ẹgbẹ to wulo ti a yan fun piparẹ.','%s group deleted'=>'%s ẹgbẹ ti paarẹ','New group created.'=>'Ẹgbẹ tuntun ti ṣẹda.','Add New Group'=>'Fi Ẹgbẹ Tuntun Kun','User Groups'=>'Awọn Ẹgbẹ Olumulo','WordPress Role'=>'Ipa WordPress','WordPress Roles'=>'Awọn Ipa WordPress','%1$sGroup Type:%2$s %3$s'=>'%1$sIru Ẹgbẹ:%2$s %3$s','Has Permissions'=>'Ni Awọn Aṣẹ','Has Specific Permissions'=>'Ni Awọn Aṣẹ Pataki','Has Extra Roles'=>'Ni Awọn Ipa Afikun','Search Results for &#8220;%s&#8221;'=>'Awọn esi ìwádìí fún &#8220;%s&#8221;','Search Groups'=>'Wá ẹgbẹ́','All Users'=>'Gbogbo awọn olumulo','Has Permissions Set Directly'=>'Ni ìfẹ́sẹ̀kẹ́sẹ̀ tó ṣe taara','No Custom Group'=>'Ko si ẹgbẹ́ aṣa','No matching groups were found.'=>'Ko si awọn ẹgbẹ́ to baamu ti a rí.','Delete'=>'Pa','Type'=>'Iru','Workflow'=>'Ilana iṣẹ́','edit group permissions'=>'ṣe àtúnṣe awọn ìfẹ́sẹ̀kẹ́sẹ̀ ẹgbẹ́','ERROR'=>'Aṣiṣe','Please enter a group name.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ orukọ ẹgbẹ́ kan.','This group name is already registered. Please choose another one.'=>'Orukọ ẹgbẹ́ yìí ti forúkọsílẹ̀ tẹlẹ. Jọ̀wọ́ yan omiiran.','You can&#8217;t delete that group.'=>'Iwọ kò le pa ẹgbẹ́ yẹn.','To block direct access to unreadable files, activate the File Access feature.'=>'Lati ṣe idiwọ iraye taara si awọn faili ti ko le ka, mu ẹya iraye si faili ṣiṣẹ.','To block direct access to unreadable files, %1$supgrade to Permissions Pro%2$s and enable the File Access feature.'=>'Lati ṣe idiwọ iraye taara si awọn faili ti ko le ka, %1$sṣe imudojuiwọn si Permissions Pro%2$s ki o si mu ẹya iraye si faili ṣiṣẹ.','To customize editing permissions, enable the Editing Permissions feature.'=>'Lati ṣe àṣà awọn ìfẹ́sẹ̀kẹ́sẹ̀ àtúnṣe, mu iṣẹ́ Àtúnṣe Awọn Ìfẹ́sẹ̀kẹ́sẹ̀ ṣiṣẹ́.','Block URL access'=>'Dènà ìwọle URL','To block direct URL access to attachments of unreadable posts, activate the File Access feature.'=>'Lati ṣe idiwọ iraye URL taara si awọn asopọ ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ko le ka, mu ẹya iraye si faili ṣiṣẹ.','To block direct URL access to attachments of unreadable posts, %1$supgrade to Permissions Pro%2$s and enable the File Access feature.'=>'Lati ṣe idiwọ iraye URL taara si awọn asopọ ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ko le ka, %1$sṣe imudojuiwọn si Permissions Pro%2$s ki o si mu ẹya iraye si faili ṣiṣẹ.','Customize'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe','To customize publication workflow, %1$sinstall PublishPress Statuses%2$s.'=>'Lati ṣe àtúnṣe iṣẹ́ ìtẹ̀jáde, %1$sfi sori ẹrọ PublishPress Statuses%2$s.','Show list of Permissions Pro features and screencasts'=>'Fihan atokọ awọn ẹya Permisions Pro ati awọn screencasts','Knowledge Base'=>'Ibi ìmọ̀','Detailed Feature Grid'=>'Grid Ẹya Alaye','Contact Us'=>'Kan si wa','Purchase'=>'Ra','Hide'=>'Tọju','None. All %ss will be hidden by default.'=>'Kò sí. Gbogbo %ss ni a yoo tọju laifọwọyi.','Add Selected Permissions'=>'Fikun-un Awọn Aṣẹ Ti a Yan','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'Ti o ba nilo iranlọwọ tabi ti o ba ni ibeere ẹya tuntun, jẹ ki a mọ.','Upgrade to Pro'=>'Gba iriri Pro','Request Support'=>'Beere atilẹyin','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Itọsọna alaye tun wa lori oju opo wẹẹbu plugin naa.','View Knowledge Base'=>'Wo Ibi ìmọ̀','All settings were updated.'=>'Gbogbo awọn eto ti ṣe imudojuiwọn.','All settings were reset to defaults.'=>'Gbogbo awọn eto ti ṣe atunṣe si awọn aiyipada.','Save Changes'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Ayipada','Upgrade to Permissions Pro'=>'Gba iriri Permissions Pro','Need Permissions Support?'=>'Nilo Atilẹyin Aṣẹ?','If disabled, manually "blocked" posts can be unblocked by specific Category / Term Permissions.'=>'Ti a ko ba mu, awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a “dẹkun” le ṣee ṣe atunṣe nipasẹ awọn aṣẹ Ẹka / Ọrọ kan pato.','If enabled, corresponding Media edit and delete capabilities must be added to existing roles.'=>'Ti a ba mu, awọn agbara ṣiṣatunkọ ati piparẹ Media ti o baamu gbọdọ wa ni afikun si awọn ipa ti o wa tẹlẹ.','For specialized Media Library permissions, enable the Editing Permissions feature.'=>'Fun awọn aṣẹ ile-ikawe Media pataki, mu ẹya Aṣẹ Ṣiṣatunkọ ṣiṣẹ.','To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate the Compatibility Pack feature.'=>'Lati ṣe akanṣe awọn aṣẹ forum bbPress, mu ẹya Compatibility Pack ṣiṣẹ.','To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate your Permissions Pro license key.'=>'Lati ṣe akanṣe awọn aṣẹ forum bbPress, mu bọtini iwe-aṣẹ Permissions Pro rẹ ṣiṣẹ.','Remove the "Private:" and "Protected" prefix from Post, Page titles.'=>'Yọ prefix "Ikọkọ:" ati "Ti a daabobo" kuro ninu awọn akọle Ifiweranṣẹ, Oju-iwe.','If the user is blocked from reading posts in a category, also block access to category archive page.'=>'Ti olumulo ba ti dẹkun lati ka awọn ifiweranṣẹ ni ẹka kan, dẹkun iraye si oju-iwe àkọsílẹ ẹka naa ni tun.','Remove unreadable Menu Items. If menu rendering problems occur with a third party plugin, disable this setting.'=>'Yọ awọn Ẹya Akọkọ ti ko le ka. Ti awọn iṣoro sisẹ akojọ ba ṣẹlẹ pẹlu afikun ẹgbẹ kẹta, pa eto yii.','Unmodified from WordPress default behavior. To enable filtering, remove constant definition PP_ADMIN_READONLY_LISTABLE.'=>'Ko yipada lati ihuwasi aiyipada WordPress. Lati mu àlẹmọ ṣiṣẹ, yọ itọnisọna iduro PP_ADMIN_READONLY_LISTABLE.','Note: Groups and Roles are always displayed on the Edit User screen.'=>'Akiyesi: Awọn ẹgbẹ ati Awọn ipa nigbagbogbo ni a fihan lori iboju Ṣatunkọ Olumulo.','Disable Permissions filtering for users who are not logged in.'=>'Pa asẹ igbanilaaye fun awọn olumulo ti ko ti wọle.','Legacy compatibility: front end term filters are not applied on some sites.'=>'Ibaṣepọ atijọ: awọn asẹ ọrọ igba iwaju ko ti lo lori diẹ ninu awọn aaye.','If checked, pages blocked from the "All" or "Logged In" groups will still be listed to Administrators.'=>'Ti a ba ṣayẹwo, awọn oju-iwe ti a dẹkun lati awọn ẹgbẹ "Gbogbo" tabi "Ti wọle" yoo tun wa ni akojọ fun awọn Alakoso.','Display a role dropdown alongside the user search input box to narrow results.'=>'Fihan akojọ aṣayan ipa lẹgbẹẹ apoti ìwádìí olumulo lati dinku awọn abajade.','Display descriptive captions on Permissions screens.'=>'Fihan awọn akọsilẹ alaye lori awọn iboju Igbasilẹ.','Display descriptive captions for features available in missing or deactivated modules.'=>'Fihan awọn akọle apejuwe fun awọn ẹya ti o wa ninu awọn modulu ti o padanu tabi ti a pa.','Extra Roles cause "_posts" capabilities in the Pattern Role (Author, Editor, etc.) to be assigned for the selected post type. Enable this setting to also include all other capabilities in the Pattern Role.'=>'Awọn ipa afikun fa "_posts" awọn agbara ninu Ipa Àkóónú (Onkọwe, Olùdarí, ati bẹbẹ lọ) lati jẹ assigned fun iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan. Mu eto yii ṣiṣẹ lati tun pẹlu gbogbo awọn agbara miiran ninu Ipa Àkóónú.','Detect user roles which are appended dynamically but not stored to the WP database. May be useful for sites that sync with Active Directory or other external user registration systems.'=>'Ṣawari awọn ipa olumulo ti a so pọ ni iyara ṣugbọn ti a ko fipamọ si ipilẹ data WP. Le jẹ wulo fun awọn aaye ti o nṣiṣẹ pẹlu Active Directory tabi awọn eto iforukọsilẹ olumulo ita miiran.','You can adjust some Permissions behavior by %1$s adding capabilities to a WordPress role%2$s.'=>'O le ṣe akanṣe diẹ ninu ihuwasi Awọn Ẹtọ nipa %1$s fi awọn agbara kun si ipa WordPress%2$s.','You can add Permissions capabilities to a role using the %1$s plugin.'=>'O le fi agbara Awọn Iwe-ẹri kun si ipa kan nipa lilo %1$s plugin.','Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_view_permissions capability is also required.'=>'Laibikita eto yii, agbara pp_set_view_permissions tun jẹ dandan.','Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_edit_permissions capability is also required.'=>'Laibikita eto yii, agbara pp_set_edit_permissions tun jẹ dandan.','Settings related to content editing permissions, provided by the %s module.'=>'Awọn eto ti o ni ibatan si awọn iwe-ašẹ akoonu, ti a pese nipasẹ %s module.','If this setting is disabled, you can enable a role by giving it capabilities: list_others_posts, list_others_published_pages, etc.'=>'Ti eto yii ba ti pa, o le mu ipa kan ṣiṣẹ nipa fifun ni awọn agbara: list_others_posts, list_others_published_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ.','Display a custom column on Edit Posts screen for all related taxonomies which are enabled for Permissions filtering.'=>'Fihan ọwọn aṣa kan lori iboju Ṣatunkọ Awọn ifiweranṣẹ fun gbogbo awọn taxonomy ti o ni ibatan ti a mu ṣiṣẹ fun àlẹmọ Awọn Ẹtọ.','Allows creation of a new post (of any type) for each selected user, using an existing post as the pattern.'=>'Gba laaye lati ṣẹda ifiweranṣẹ tuntun (ti iru eyikeyi) fun gbogbo olumulo ti a yan, nipa lilo ifiweranṣẹ to wa tẹlẹ gẹgẹbi àpẹẹrẹ.','Other users will be unable to publish new top-level pages (Parent = "Main Page"), or move a published page from "Main Page" to a different Parent.'=>'Awọn olumulo miiran kii yoo ni anfani lati tẹjade awọn oju-iwe ipele oke tuntun (Iya = "Oju-iwe Pataki"), tabi gbe oju-iwe ti a tẹjade lati "Oju-iwe Pataki" si Iya miiran.','This feature has been moved to PublishPress Capabilities > Editor Features > Element IDs. Please use the Capabilities plugin for better organization and enhanced functionality.'=>'Iwọn ẹya yii ti wa ni gbigbe si PublishPress Awọn Agbara > Awọn ẹya Olùdarí > Awọn ID Ẹlemẹnti. Jọwọ lo plugin Awọn Agbara fun iṣakoso ti o dara julọ ati iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti o ni ilọsiwaju.','The following settings are currently overridden by the constant PP_MEDIA_LIB_UNFILTERED (defined in wp-config.php or some other file you maintain). Media Library access will not be altered by Permissions.'=>'Awọn eto atẹle ti wa ni yipada lọwọlọwọ nipasẹ iduro PP_MEDIA_LIB_UNFILTERED (ti a ṣe alaye ninu wp-config.php tabi faili miiran ti o n ṣetọju). Iwọle si Ile-ikawe Media kii yoo yipada nipasẹ Awọn Ẹtọ.','Show files uploaded by others users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to view.'=>'Fihan awọn faili ti awọn olumulo miiran gbe kalẹ ti wọn ba so pọ si ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo naa ni igbanilaaye lati wo.','Show files uploaded by other users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'Fihan awọn faili ti awọn olumulo miiran gbe kalẹ ti wọn ba so pọ si ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo naa ni igbanilaaye lati satunkọ.','Allow users to edit files uploaded by other users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'Gba laaye awọn olumulo lati satunkọ awọn faili ti wọn ti gbe kalẹ nipasẹ awọn olumulo miiran ti wọn ba so pọ si ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo naa ni igbanilaaye lati satunkọ.','Show users all the files in the Media Library. Unchecking this box will hide media files that are uploaded by other users.'=>'Fihan awọn olumulo gbogbo awọn faili ninu Ile-ikawe Media. Iwọntunwọnsi apoti yii yoo pa awọn faili media ti a gbe kalẹ nipasẹ awọn olumulo miiran.','Stop users from editing files uploaded by other users unless they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'Dena awọn olumulo lati satunkọ awọn faili ti a gbe kalẹ nipasẹ awọn olumulo miiran ayafi ti wọn ba so pọ si ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo naa ni igbanilaaye lati satunkọ.','Allow users to edit files they have uploaded, regardless of other restrictions.'=>'Gba laaye awọn olumulo lati satunkọ awọn faili ti wọn ti gbe kalẹ, laibikita awọn ihamọ miiran.','Allow non-Administrators to rename menu items they cannot fully edit. Menu items will be locked into current positions.'=>'Gba laaye awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati tun awọn ohun akojọ orukọ ti wọn ko le satunkọ ni kikun. Awọn ohun akojọ yoo wa ni titi di ipo lọwọlọwọ.','Prevent creation or editing of custom items for non-Administrators who lack edit_theme_options capability.'=>'Dena ẹda tabi ṣiṣatunkọ awọn nkan aṣa fun awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso ti ko ni agbara edit_theme_options.','Prevent non-Administrators with user editing permissions from editing a higher-level user or assigning a role higher than their own.'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso pẹlu awọn igbanilaaye ṣiṣatunkọ olumulo lati ṣiṣatunkọ olumulo ipele-giga tabi lati funni ni ipa ti o ga ju tiwọn lọ.','Circle members will be blocked from accessing Revisions authored by non-members.'=>'Awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ Circle yoo ni idiwọ lati wọle si awọn Atunṣe ti awọn ti kii ṣe ọmọ ẹgbẹ kọ.','Enable post contributors or authors with pp_set_edit_permissions capability to set editing Permissions on posts authored by others'=>'Mú ki awọn olutọka ifiweranṣẹ tabi awọn onkọwe pẹlu agbara pp_set_edit_permissions lati ṣeto awọn Iwọle ṣiṣatunkọ lori awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a kọ nipasẹ awọn miiran','Permissions setting \'Pages can be set or removed from Top Level by\' applies to \'page\' type only'=>'Iṣeto awọn igbanilaaye \'Awọn oju-ewe le ṣee ṣeto tabi yọkuro lati Ipele Giga nipasẹ\' kan si iru \'oju-ewe\' nikan','If user cannot generally save pages to top level but a page they are editing is already there, allow it to stay at top level even if not yet published '=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le fipamọ awọn oju-ewe si ipele oke ni gbogbogbo ṣugbọn oju-iwe ti wọn n ṣatunkọ wa nibẹ tẹlẹ, gba a laaye lati duro ni ipele oke paapaa ti ko ba ti tẹjade sibẹsibẹ ','Circle membership does not limit page association (page parent setting) ability'=>'Ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ Circle ko ni idiwọ agbara asopọ oju-iwe (iṣeto obi oju-iwe)','Determines the default value of Permissions > Settings > Editing > Auto-assign default term'=>'Ṣe idanimọ iye aiyipada ti Awọn igbanilaaye > Eto > Ṣiṣatunkọ > Aiyipada aiyipada auto-assign','Always auto-assign a category if none are selected and user lacks permission for default category'=>'Maṣe auto-assign ẹka kan ti ko ba si ọkan ti a yan ati pe olumulo ko ni igbanilaaye fun ẹka aiyipada','Always auto-assign a post tag if none are selected'=>'Nígbà gbogbo, aiyé àtúnṣe àkọ́kọ́ yóò jẹ́ kí aami ifiweranṣẹ kan nígbà tí kò sí aami tó yàn','Always auto-assign a term of this taxonomy if none are selected'=>'Nígbà gbogbo, aiyé àtúnṣe àkọ́kọ́ yóò jẹ́ kí ìpinnu ti taxonomy yìí nígbà tí kò sí ìpinnu tó yàn','Determines the default setting of Permissions > Settings > Editing > Auto-assign default terms'=>'Ṣe idanimọ iṣeto aiyipada ti Awọn igbanilaaye > Eto > Ṣiṣatunkọ > Aiyipada awọn ọrọ auto-assign','Do not auto-assign a category (except standard default category if user has permission)'=>'Maṣe auto-assign ọrọ kan (sii ẹka aiyipada boṣewa ti olumulo ba ni igbanilaaye)','Do not auto-assign a post tag'=>'Má ṣe aiyé àtúnṣe àkọ́kọ́ fún aami ifiweranṣẹ','Do not auto-assign a term of this taxonomy'=>'Má ṣe aiyé àtúnṣe àkọ́kọ́ fún ìpinnu ti taxonomy yìí','Do not auto-assign a term if the user has permission for more than one term in the taxonomy'=>'Maṣe auto-assign ọrọ kan ti olumulo ba ni igbanilaaye fun diẹ ẹ sii ju ọrọ kan lọ ninu taxonomy','If auto-assign term setting is enabled, apply it even if user does not have term assignment limitations'=>'Ti iṣeto auto-assign ọrọ ba ti muu ṣiṣẹ, lo o paapaa ti olumulo ko ba ni awọn ihamọ asopọ ọrọ','Don\'t define an \'Approved\' status, even if Status Control feature is active'=>'Má ṣe ṣàlàyé ipo \'Ti fọwọ́sí\', bí ipò iṣakoso Status bá ṣiṣẹ́','If user has Nav Menu management capabilities but can\'t \'edit_theme_options\', strip link out of wp-admin Appearance Menu instead of linking it to nav-menus'=>'Ti olumulo ba ni awọn agbara iṣakoso Akosile Nav ṣugbọn ko le \'edit_theme_options\', yọ ọna asopọ kuro ninu wp-admin Appearance Menu dipo ki o so mọ nav-menus','Don\'t credit implicit \'manage_nav_menus\' capability to users who have \'edit_theme_options\' or \'switch_themes\' capability'=>'Maṣe fi agbara aiyipada \'manage_nav_menus\' fun awọn olumulo ti o ni \'edit_theme_options\' tabi \'switch_themes\' agbara','Prevent non-Administrators from adding new Nav Menu items to top level (add below existing editable items instead)'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati ṣafikun awọn nkan Akosile Nav tuntun si ipele giga (fi kun labẹ awọn nkan ti o le ṣatunkọ tẹlẹ dipo)','For non-Administrators, new Nav Menu items default to being a child of first editable item '=>'Fun awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso, awọn nkan Akosile Nav tuntun dafault si ọmọ ti ohun ti o le ṣatunkọ akọkọ ','Don\'t require any additional capabilities for management of Nav Menu settings (normally require \'manage_menu_settings\', \'edit_others_pages\' or \'publish_pages\') '=>'Maṣe nilo eyikeyi awọn agbara afikun fun iṣakoso awọn eto Akosile Nav (nigbagbogbo nilo \'manage_menu_settings\', \'edit_others_pages\' tabi \'publish_pages\')','Eliminate extra filtering queries on Nav Menu update, even for non-Administrators'=>'Yọ awọn ibeere àlẹmọ afikun lori imudojuiwọn Akosile Nav, paapaa fun awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso','Don\'t allow non-Administrators to see others\' unattached uploads, regardless of Permissions settings.  Their own unattached uploads are still accessible unless option \'own_attachments_always_editable\' is set false'=>'Ma jẹ ki awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso ri awọn ikojọpọ ti ko ni asopọ ti awọn miiran, laibikita awọn eto Awọn igbanilaaye. Awọn ikojọpọ tiwọn ti ko ni asopọ ṣi wa ni iraye si ayafi ti aṣayan \'own_attachments_always_editable\' ba jẹ false','Limited User Editors can assign their own role'=>'Awọn Onkọwe Olumulo to lopin le yan ipa tirẹ','Post Meta fields to copy when using \'Add Author Page\' dropdown on Users screen'=>'Awọn aaye Meta Post lati daakọ nigbati o ba nlo \'Fi kun Olootu Oju-iwe\' aṣayan ni iboju Awọn olumulo','Manage PublishPress Permissions plugin settings.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn eto afikun PublishPress Permissions.','Access the Teaser settings admin screen.'=>'Wọle si awọn eto Teaser iboju alakoso.','PublishPress Permissions will not apply any Extra Roles or Permissions to limit or expand viewing or editing access.'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye PublishPress ko ni lo eyikeyi Awọn ipa afikun tabi Awọn igbanilaaye lati dinku tabi pọ si iraye si wiwo tabi ṣiṣatunkọ.','Manage other user\'s Permissions. Also grants capabilities for all post types and statuses.'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn igbanilaaye ti olumulo miiran. Tun fun awọn agbara fun gbogbo awọn iru post ati ipo.','Create new Permission Groups and set the name and description.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn Ẹgbẹ Ẹtọ tuntun ki o si ṣeto orukọ ati apejuwe.','Edit the name and description of existing Permission Groups.'=>'Ṣatunkọ orukọ ati apejuwe ti awọn Ẹgbẹ Ẹtọ to wa tẹlẹ.','Delete Permission Groups.'=>'Pa awọn Ẹgbẹ Ẹtọ.','If group editing is allowed, can also modify group membership.'=>'Ti a ba gba ṣiṣatunkọ ẹgbẹ laaye, tun le yipada ọmọ ẹgbẹ ẹgbẹ.','Assign Extra Roles or Permissions on the Edit Permissions screen.'=>'Yan Awọn ipa tabi Awọn ẹtọ afikun lori iboju Ṣatunkọ Awọn ẹtọ.','Set Viewing Permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'Ṣeto Awọn ẹtọ Wiwo fun Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ, Awọn ẹka tabi Awọn ọrọ pato.','Set Editing Permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'Ṣeto Awọn ẹtọ Ṣiṣatunkọ fun Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ, Awọn ẹka tabi Awọn ọrọ pato.','Set Revision Permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'Ṣeto Awọn ẹtọ Atunṣe fun Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ, Awọn ẹka tabi Awọn ọrọ pato.','Set "Set as Parent" Permissions for specific Posts.'=>'Ṣeto Awọn ẹtọ "Ṣeto gẹgẹbi Ẹgbẹ" fun Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ pato.','Set Term Assignment Permissions.'=>'Ṣeto Awọn ẹtọ Atunṣe Ọrọ.','Set Term Management Permissions.'=>'Ṣeto Awọn ẹtọ Iṣakoso Ọrọ.','Set "Set as Parent" Permissions for specific Categories or Terms.'=>'Set "Set as Parent" Awọn aṣẹ fun awọn ẹka tabi awọn ọrọ pato.','Edit own file uploads, even if they become attached to an uneditable post.'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn igbasilẹ faili tirẹ, paapaa ti wọn ba di asopọ si ifiweranṣẹ ti ko le satunkọ.','See other user\'s unattached file uploads in Media Library.'=>'Wo awọn igbasilẹ faili ti olumulo miiran ti ko ni asopọ ni Ile-ikawe Media.','Can bypass restrictive "Set as Parent" Permissions (for all hierarchical post types).'=>'Le kọja awọn igbanilaaye ti o ni ihamọ "Ṣeto gẹgẹbi Iya" (fun gbogbo awọn iru post ti o ni ihamọ).','Do not alter the Media Library listing provided by WordPress.'=>'Ma ṣe yi atokọ Ile-ikawe Media ti WordPress pese pada.','On the Posts screen, satisfy a missing edit_posts capability by listing uneditable drafts.'=>'Ni iboju Awọn Posts, pa aini agbara edit_posts kan nipa atokọ awọn apẹrẹ ti ko le ṣe atunṣe.','On the Posts screen, satisfy a missing edit_others_posts capability by listing other user\'s uneditable posts.'=>'Ni iboju Awọn Posts, pa aini agbara edit_others_posts kan nipa atokọ awọn post ti olumulo miiran ti ko le ṣe atunṣe.','On the Pages screen, satisfy a missing edit_private_pages capability by listing uneditable private pages.'=>'Ni iboju Awọn Oju-iwe, pa aini agbara edit_private_pages kan nipa atokọ awọn oju-iwe ikọkọ ti ko le ṣe atunṣe.','Allow non-Administrators to Quick Edit or Bulk Edit (possibly allowing them to bypass restrictions).'=>'Jẹ ki awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso ṣe Ṣatunkọ Yara tabi Ṣatunkọ Ẹgbẹ (bóyá jẹ ki wọn kọja awọn ihamọ).','(Statuses Pro capability)'=>'(Iṣẹ agbara Statuses Pro)','Advanced'=>'Ipele to Ti ni ilọsiwaju','Advanced Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Ti ni ilọsiwaju','Network-Wide Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Agbegbe-Nla','Editor Options'=>'Awọn aṣayan Editeur','Page Structure'=>'Iṣeto Oju ewe','Permissions Capabilities'=>'Awọn agbara Aṣẹ','Front End'=>'Ipele iwaju','User Management'=>'Iṣakoso Olumulo','Constants'=>'Awọn Iye','Role Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ Ipa','Nav Menu Editing'=>'Ìtúnṣe Àkójọpọ̀ Nav','Miscellaneous'=>'Àwọn nkan míì','Display all advanced settings'=>'Fihan gbogbo àtúnṣe to ti ni ilọsiwaju','Use modern tabbed metabox interface'=>'Lo àpapọ̀ metabox ti a ti ṣe àtúnṣe tuntun','Delete settings on plugin deletion'=>'Pa àtúnṣe mọ́ nígbà ti a bá pa plugin run','Post-specific Permissions take priority'=>'Ìfọwọ́sí tó jẹ́ ti ìsopọpọ́ àkọsílẹ̀ ni àìlera','Search Results include Media'=>'Àbájáde Ìwádìí ní ìkànsí Media','Regulate access to Category archive pages'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe iraye si àwọn ojúewé àkọsílẹ̀ ẹka','Performance: Don\'t filter category / tag counts'=>'Ìṣe: Má ṣe àlẹmọ́ àkóónú ẹka / tag','Filter Menu Items'=>'Àlẹmọ́ Àwọn Nkan Menu','Page Parent selection for editable pages only'=>'Ìdáhùn Ibi Ẹ̀ka fún àwọn ojúewé tí a lè ṣe àtúnṣe nikan','Auto-assign available term if default term is unavailable'=>'Tẹ́lẹ̀-ṣe àtúnṣe àkóónú tó wà bí àkóónú àkọsílẹ̀ ko ba wà','List other user\'s uneditable posts'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ tí awọn olumulo míì ko lè ṣe àtúnṣe','Pages can be set or removed from Top Level by: '=>'Àwọn ojúewé lè jẹ́ àtúnṣe tàbí yọkúrò ní Top Level nipasẹ: ','Tag creation requires Tag edit capability'=>'Ìdásílẹ̀ tag nilo agbára àtúnṣe tag','Type-specific Extra Roles grant all capabilities in Pattern Role'=>'Àwọn ipa afikun tí a sọtọ̀ sí irú n jẹ́ kí gbogbo agbára wa nínú Ipa Àdàkọ','Suppress "Private: " Caption'=>'Dákẹ́ "Pátá: " Àkọlé','Select Permission Groups at User creation'=>'Yan Àwọn Ẹgbẹ́ Ìfọwọ́sí nígbà ìdásílẹ̀ Olumulo','Permission Groups on User Profile'=>'Àwọn Ẹgbẹ́ Ìfọwọ́sí lórí Profaili Olumulo','Extra Roles on User Profile'=>'Àwọn Ipa afikun lórí Profaili Olumulo','Order Page Parent dropdown by Title'=>'Ibi aṣẹ Ibi ti o wa ni isalẹ nipasẹ Akọle','Add taxonomy columns to Edit Posts screen'=>'Fi awọn ọwọn taxonomy kun si iboju Ṣatunkọ Awọn ifiweranṣẹ','Allow Renaming of uneditable Items'=>'Gba laaye Atunṣe ti awọn ohun ti ko le ṣe atunṣe','Lock custom menu items'=>'Dena awọn nkan akojọ aṣa','Bulk Add Author Pages on Users screen'=>'Fi awọn oju-iwe Onkọwe pọ si ni iboju Awọn olumulo','%1$sDisable%2$s all filtering for anonymous users'=>'%1$sDena%2$s gbogbo àlẹmọ fun awọn olumulo aimi','%1$sDo not apply%2$s metagroup permissions for Administrators'=>'%1$sMa ṣe lo%2$s awọn ẹtọ metagroup fun Awọn Alakoso','Limit front-end category / term filtering'=>'Dín àlẹmọ ẹka / ọrọ ni iwaju','User Search: Filter by WP role'=>'Iwadi Olumulo: Àlẹmọ nipasẹ ipa WP','Display Administrative Hints'=>'Fihan Awọn itọkasi Iṣakoso','Display Module Hints'=>'Fihan Awọn itọkasi Modulu','Detect Dynamically Mapped WP Roles'=>'Ṣawari Awọn Ipa WP ti a ṣe apẹrẹ ni Igbimọ','Non-Administrators can set Reading Permissions for their editable posts'=>'Awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso le ṣe eto Awọn ẹtọ kika fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti wọn le satunkọ','Bulk Add / Remove Groups on Users Screen'=>'Fi ẹgbẹ pọ si / Yọ ẹgbẹ kuro ni iboju Awọn olumulo','Non-Administrators can set Editing Permissions for their editable posts'=>'Awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso le ṣe eto Awọn ẹtọ ṣiṣatunkọ fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti wọn le satunkọ','Assign Publish Permissions separate from Edit Permissions'=>'Yàn awọn ẹtọ Ifiweranṣẹ ni iyatọ lati Awọn ẹtọ Ṣatunkọ','note: Plugin settings and configuration data will be deleted, but only after the last copy of Permissions / Permissions Pro is deleted.'=>'akọsilẹ: Awọn eto Plugin ati data iṣeto yoo parẹ, ṣugbọn nikan lẹhin ti ẹda ikẹhin ti Awọn igbanilaaye / Awọn igbanilaaye Pro ti parẹ.','The following would revert to default settings:'=>'Eyi ni yoo pada si awọn eto aiyipada:','The following would change from defaults to previously stored settings:'=>'Eyi ni yoo yipada lati awọn aiyipada si awọn eto ti a ti fipamọ tẹlẹ:','no Page Parent filter'=>'ko si àlẹmọ Ibi Aṣẹ','Page Authors, Editors and Administrators'=>'Awọn onkọwe, awọn olootu ati awọn alakoso Oju-iwe','Page Editors and Administrators'=>'Awọn olootu Oju-iwe ati awọn alakoso','Administrators'=>'Awọn alakoso','When saving a post, if the default term is not selectable, substitute first available.'=>'Nigbati o ba fipamọ post kan, ti ọrọ aiyipada ko ba le yan, rọpo pẹlu akọkọ ti o wa.','Some term-limited editing configurations require this.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn iṣeto ṣiṣatunkọ ti a fi opin si ọrọ nilo eyi.','If enabled, users cannot create new tags for a post unless they have the edit_tags capability. You can manage this with a WordPress role editor like PublishPress Capabilities.'=>'Ti a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn olumulo ko le ṣẹda awọn aami tuntun fun post kan ayafi ti wọn ba ni agbara edit_tags. O le ṣakoso eyi pẹlu olootu ipa WordPress kan gẹgẹbi PublishPress Capabilities.','If enabled, users cannot create new tags for a post unless they have the edit_tags capability. You can manage this with Capabilities > Capabilities > Taxonomies for any role.'=>'Ti a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn olumulo ko le ṣẹda awọn aami tuntun fun post kan ayafi ti wọn ba ni agbara edit_tags. O le ṣakoso eyi pẹlu Awọn Agbara > Awọn Agbara > Taxonomies fun eyikeyi ipa.','Display all permission operations in a single metabox with tabs (modern UI). When disabled, each operation has a separate metabox (legacy UI).'=>'Fihan gbogbo awọn iṣẹ igbanilaaye ni metabox kan pẹlu awọn taabu (UI igbalode). Nigbati a ko ba mu ṣiṣẹ, iṣẹ kọọkan ni metabox lọtọ (UI atijọ).','%sPosts / Pages Listing:%s %s'=>'%sAwọn Ifiweranṣẹ / Awọn Oju-iwe Atokọ:%s %s','User editing capabilities apply for'=>'Awọn agbara ṣiṣatunkọ olumulo lo wa fun','any user'=>'ẹnikẹni','equal or lower role levels'=>'iyato tabi awọn ipele ipa kekere','lower role levels'=>'awọn ipele ipa kekere','To control how Extra Roles are applied, see %1$sRole Usage%2$s.'=>'Lati ṣakoso bi Awọn Ipa afikun ṣe n ṣiṣẹ, wo %1$sIlo Ipa%2$s.','Defined Constant'=>'Iwọn to wa','Setting'=>'Iṣeto','Available Constant'=>'Iwọn to wa','To modify one or more default settings network-wide, <strong>copy</strong> the following code into your theme\'s <strong>functions.php</strong> file (or some other file which is always executed and not auto-updated) and modify as desired:'=>'Lati ṣe atunṣe ọkan tabi diẹ ẹ sii ti awọn eto aiyipada ni gbogbo nẹtiwọki, <strong>daakọ</strong> koodu atẹle sinu faili <strong>functions.php</strong> ti akori rẹ (tabi faili miiran ti a ṣe nigbagbogbo ati ti ko ni imudojuiwọn laifọwọyi) ki o si ṣe atunṣe gẹgẹ bi a ṣe fẹ:','To force the value of one or more settings network-wide, <strong>copy</strong> the following code into your theme\'s <strong>functions.php</strong> file (or some other file which is always executed and not auto-updated) and modify as desired:'=>'Lati fi agbara mu iye ti ọkan tabi diẹ ẹ sii ti awọn eto ni gbogbo nẹtiwọki, <strong>daakọ</strong> koodu atẹle sinu faili <strong>functions.php</strong> ti akori rẹ (tabi faili miiran ti a ṣe nigbagbogbo ati ti ko ni imudojuiwọn laifọwọyi) ki o si ṣe atunṣe gẹgẹ bi a ṣe fẹ:','All settings in this form (including those on undisplayed tabs) will be reset to DEFAULTS.  Are you sure?'=>'Gbogbo awọn eto ni fọọmu yii (pẹlu awọn ti o wa lori awọn taabu ti a ko fihan) yoo tunṣe si DEFAULTS. Ṣe o da ọ loju?','Revert to Defaults'=>'Pada si awọn aiyipada','General'=>'Gbogbogbo','Taxonomies'=>'Iru-owo','Post Types'=>'Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','Database Maintenance'=>'Itoju Database','Enforce distinct edit, delete capability requirements for Media'=>'Fi agbara mu awọn ibeere iyatọ fun ṣiṣatunkọ, piparẹ fun Media','Modify permissions for these Taxonomies:'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn igbanilaaye fun awọn Iru-owo wọnyi:','Modify permissions for these Post Types:'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn igbanilaaye fun awọn Iru Ifiweranṣẹ wọnyi:','This causes unique capabilities to be required for editing each post type. '=>'Eyi fa ki a beere awọn agbara alailẹgbẹ fun ṣiṣatunkọ iru ifiweranṣẹ kọọkan. ','Nav Menus (Block)'=>'Awọn akojọ aṣayan Nav (Bloku)','Metabox enabled'=>'Metabox ti ṣiṣẹ','Metabox disabled'=>'Metabox ti pa','Permissions screen enabled'=>'Ibuwọlu igi ti ṣiṣẹ','Permissions screen disabled'=>'Ibuwọlu igi ti pa','This feature allows you to restrict access to Media Library files when they are accessed via WordPress. To restrict viewing of files when they are visited directly via the URL, use the "File Access" feature.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati dènà iraye si awọn faili ile-ikawe Media nigbati a ba wọle si wọn nipasẹ WordPress. Lati dènà wiwo awọn faili nigbati a ba ṣabẹwo si wọn taara nipasẹ URL, lo ẹya "Iraye si Faili".','Enable metabox on %s editing screen'=>'Muu metabox ṣiṣẹ lori iboju ṣiṣatunkọ %s','Enable on Permissions screen'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ lori iboju igbanilaaye','Make Unattached Files Private'=>'Ṣe awọn faili ti ko ni asopọ ni ikọkọ'