ts for your users?'=>'Ṣe o setan lati ṣẹda awọn ifiweranṣẹ laifọwọyi fun awọn olumulo rẹ?','Upgrade to Pro and get advanced user post generation with all these features and more.'=>'Mu u pọ si Pro ki o si gba iṣelọpọ ifiweranṣẹ olumulo to ti ni ilọsiwaju pẹlu gbogbo awọn ẹya wọnyi ati diẹ sii.','Username'=>'Orukọ olumulo','Email'=>'Imeeli','Specific Permissions %1$s'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye pato %1$s','Specific Permissions assigned directly to the user'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye pato ti a ṣe atunto taara si olumulo','Specific Permissions assigned to the user or one of their groups'=>'Awọn igbanilaaye pato ti a ṣe atunto si olumulo tabi ọkan ninu awọn ẹgbẹ wọn','User Roles %1$s'=>'Ipo awọn olumulo %1$s','Roles %1$s'=>'Ipo %1$s','Roles assigned directly to the user'=>'Ipo ti a ṣe atunto taara si olumulo','Roles assigned to the user or one of their groups'=>'Ipo ti a ṣe atunto si olumulo tabi ọkan ninu awọn ẹgbẹ wọn','Edit User'=>'Ṣatunkọ Olumulo','Set Viewing permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ẹtọ wiwo fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ, awọn ẹka tabi awọn ọrọ pato.','Set Editing permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ẹtọ ṣiṣatunkọ fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ, awọn ẹka tabi awọn ọrọ pato.','Set "Set as Parent" permissions for specific Pages.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ẹtọ "Ṣeto gẹgẹbi Ọmọ" fun awọn oju-iwe pato.','Set Assign Term permissions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ẹtọ atunto ọrọ.','Set "Manage This Term" permissions for specific terms.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ẹ̀tọ́ "Ṣakoso Àkókò Yìí" fún àwọn àkókò pàtó.','Set "Set as Parent" permissions for specific Categories or Terms.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ẹtọ "Ṣeto gẹgẹbi Ọmọ" fun awọn ẹka tabi awọn ọrọ pato.','Set Copy Permissions for specific Posts.'=>'Ṣeto Iwọle Ikọwe fun awọn Ifiweranṣẹ pato.','Permissions & Access'=>'Iwọle & Iraye','Full editing access for all post types. Also gives the ability to edit Permissions for user roles.'=>'Ibi iraye kikun fun gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ. Tun funni ni agbara lati ṣatunkọ Awọn aṣẹ fun awọn ipa olumulo.','Access to the Settings screen.'=>'Iwọle si iboju Eto.','Access to the Teaser screen.'=>'Iwọle si iboju Teaser.','All Enabled and Blocked Permissions are ignored for this role.'=>'Gbogbo awọn ẹtọ ti a mu ṣiṣẹ ati ti a dènà ni a kọja fun ipa yii.','Create Custom Groups.'=>'Ṣẹda Awọn ẹgbẹ Aṣ customized.','View Custom Groups on the Permissions screen. Also allows access to the editing screen for Custom Groups.'=>'Wo Awọn ẹgbẹ Aṣ customized lori iboju Awọn aṣẹ. Tun gba iraye si iboju iṣatunkọ fun Awọn ẹgbẹ Aṣ customized.','Delete Custom Groups.'=>'Pa Awọn ẹgbẹ Aṣ customized.','Manage members in Custom Groups.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ ninu Awọn ẹgbẹ Aṣ customized.','Set Permissions in Post or Term Editing Screen'=>'Ṣeto Awọn Ẹ̀tọ́ ní Iboju Iṣatunkọ Ifiweranṣẹ tàbí Àkókò','Subscribers'=>'Awọn alabapin','Contributors'=>'Awọn oluranlowo','Authors'=>'Awọn onkọwe','Editors'=>'Awọn olootu','You\'re using PublishPress Permissions Free. The Pro version has more features and support. %sUpgrade to Pro%s'=>'O nlo PublishPress Permissions Free. Ẹya Pro ni awọn ẹya diẹ sii ati atilẹyin. %sMu u pọ si Pro%s','Promo file not found.'=>'Faili igbega ko ri.','Upgrade to Pro to unlock seamless integration.'=>'Ṣe atunṣe si Pro lati ṣii iṣọpọ ti ko ni idalọwọduro.','Posts Teaser'=>'Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Tí kọ́','Show a teaser message or login prompt for protected content. Available in PublishPress Permissions Pro.'=>'Fihan ifiranṣẹ ti o fa ifamọra tabi iwífún ìforúkọsílẹ fun akoonu ti a daabobo. Wa ni PublishPress Permissions Pro.','Post Statuses for Editorial Workflow'=>'Ipo Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ fún Ilana Ẹrọ Iwe','Control access to custom post statuses. This workflow feature is available in PublishPress Permissions Pro.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si awọn ipo ifiweranṣẹ aṣa. Ẹya iṣẹ yii wa ni PublishPress Permissions Pro.','Automatically generate a personal page for each user. This feature is available in PublishPress Permissions Pro.'=>'Ṣe agbejade oju-iwe ti ara ẹni laifọwọyi fun ọkọọkan awọn olumulo. Ẹya yii wa ni PublishPress Permissions Pro.','Post Visibility Statuses'=>'Ipo Ifarahan Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ','Control access to post visibility statuses. This workflow feature is available in PublishPress Permissions Pro.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si awọn ipo ifihan ifiweranṣẹ. Ẹya iṣẹ yii wa ni PublishPress Permissions Pro.','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','Account'=>'Akọọlẹ','Version'=>'Version','Version info was refreshed.'=>'Alaye version ti wa ni imudojuiwọn.','Further details for your installation:'=>'Alaye siwaju sii fun fifi sori ẹrọ rẹ:','Your presspermit.com key has expired, but a <a href="%s">PublishPress renewal</a> discount may be available.'=>'Awọn bọtini presspermit.com rẹ ti pari, ṣugbọn ẹdinwo <a href="%s">tun PublishPress</a> le wa.','Permissions Pro was previously active. You are now running the free version, with fewer features.'=>'Permissions Pro ti wa ni iṣẹ tẹlẹ. O nṣiṣẹ ẹya ọfẹ bayi, pẹlu awọn ẹya diẹ.','A presspermit.com key appears to be active. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Contact us</a> for assistance in migrating your account to publishpress.com.'=>'Bọtini presspermit.com kan dabi ẹni pe o n ṣiṣẹ. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Kan si wa</a> fun iranlọwọ ni gbigbe akọọlẹ rẹ si publishpress.com.','PublishPress Permissions Version: %1$s %2$s'=>'Version PublishPress Permissions: %1$s %2$s','%s&nbsp;details'=>'%s&nbsp;alaye','Installation History'=>'Itan Fifi sori','%s (previous install)'=>'%s (fifi sori tẹlẹ)','WordPress Version: %s'=>'Version WordPress: %s','PHP Version: %s'=>'Ẹya PHP: %s','%1$s queries in %2$s seconds. %3$s MB used.'=>'%1$s ìbéèrè ní %2$s ìsẹ́kẹsẹ́. %3$s MB lo.','Term'=>'Ìpẹ̀yà','Terms'=>'Ìpẹ̀yà','%s Manager'=>'%s Olùdarí','You do not have permission to update that Navigation Menu'=>'Ìwọ kò ni àṣẹ láti ṣe imudojuiwọn akojọ ìtòsọ́nà yẹn','You do not have permission to create new Navigation Menus'=>'Ìwọ kò ni àṣẹ láti ṣẹda àwọn akojọ ìtòsọ́nà tuntun','You do not have permission to delete that Navigation Menu.'=>'Ìwọ kò ni àṣẹ láti pa akojọ ìtòsọ́nà yẹn run.','The %s was saved, but you can no longer edit it.'=>'%s ni a fipamọ́, ṣùgbọ́n ìwọ kò le tún ṣe àtúnṣe rẹ mọ́.','Go to %s'=>'Lọ sí %s','The requested modification was processed, but you can no longer edit the post.'=>'A ti ṣe ilana iyipada ti a beere, ṣugbọn o ko le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ naa mọ.','You do not have permission to move the menu item "%1$s"'=>'Ìwọ kò ni àṣẹ láti gbe nkan akojọ "%1$s"','Return to Menu Editor'=>'Padà sí Olùṣàkóso Akojọ','You do not have permission to delete the menu item "%1$s"'=>'Ìwọ kò ni àṣẹ láti pa nkan akojọ "%1$s" run','You do not have permission to edit the menu item "%1$s"'=>'Ìwọ kò ni àṣẹ láti ṣe àtúnṣe nkan akojọ "%1$s"','Editing'=>'Ìtúnṣe','Publishing'=>'Ìtẹ̀jáde','Working Copy of'=>'Akọkọ Iṣẹ ti','Working Copy'=>'Akọkọ Iṣẹ','Submit Changes to'=>'Fi Awọn Ayipada silẹ si','Submit Changes'=>'Fi Awọn Ayipada silẹ','Request'=>'Ìbéèrè','Create Revision of'=>'Ṣẹda Atunṣe ti','Create Revision'=>'Ṣẹda Atunṣe','New Revision'=>'Ìtúnṣe Tuntun','Submit Revision of'=>'Fi Atunṣe silẹ ti','Submit Revision'=>'Fi Atunṣe silẹ','Submitted Revision'=>'Ìtúnṣe Tí a Fí Kà','Revise'=>'Tunṣe','Revision'=>'Atunṣe','Assign Term'=>'Yanjú Ọrọ','Assignment'=>'Iṣẹ́','Management'=>'Iṣakoso','(unpublished)'=>'(ti ko tẹjade)','You are not permitted to manage menu locations'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣakoso ipo akojọ','Post Approved'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ Ti fọwọsi','Page Approved'=>'Oju-iwe Ti fọwọsi','Limited Editing Elements feature has moved to <a href="%s">Capabilities > Editor Features</a>.'=>'Iṣẹ ẹya Ẹdá Iwọn to lopin ti gbe lọ si <a href="%s">Agbara > Awọn ẹya Ẹdá</a>.','Limited Editing Elements feature requires <a href="%s" target="_blank">PublishPress Capabilities</a> plugin.'=>'Iṣẹ ẹya Ẹdá Iwọn to lopin nilo <a href="%s" target="_blank">PublishPress Agbara</a> afikun.','Author Search / Select'=>'Àwárí Onkọwe / Yan','select other'=>'yan awọn miran','close'=>'pa','Permissions: Select this %1$s as Parent for All Post Types'=>'Àṣẹ: Yan %1$s yii gẹgẹbi Iya fun Gbogbo Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','Permissions: %1$s this %2$s for All Post Types'=>'Àṣẹ: %1$s yii %2$s fun Gbogbo Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','You do not have permission to select that Parent'=>'Iwọ kò ní aṣẹ láti yan Iya yẹn','%s author page added'=>'%s oju-iwe onkọwe ti a fi kun','No users selected'=>'Ko si awọn olumulo ti a yan','Selected users already have specified author page'=>'Awọn olumulo ti a yan ti ni oju-iwe onkọwe ti a sọtọ tẹlẹ','Add Author Page&hellip;'=>'Fi Oṣere Oju-iwe&hellip;','make each selected user the author of a new page'=>'ṣe ki ọkọọkan olumulo ti a yan jẹ oṣere oju-iwe tuntun','pattern post sets default content and categories for author post'=>'àpẹẹrẹ ifiweranṣẹ ṣeto akoonu aiyipada ati awọn ẹka fun ifiweranṣẹ oṣere','pattern post sets parent, default content and template for author page'=>'àpẹẹrẹ ifiweranṣẹ ṣeto obi, akoonu aiyipada ati awoṣe fun oju-iwe oṣere','pattern page sets parent and default content for author page'=>'àpẹẹrẹ oju-iwe ṣeto obi ati akoonu aiyipada fun oju-iwe oṣere','patterned on&hellip;'=>'àpẹẹrẹ lori&hellip;','patterned on...'=>'àpẹẹrẹ lori...','Pattern ID:'=>'ID Àpẹẹrẹ:','enter post ID/slug'=>'tẹ ID/slug ifiweranṣẹ','Title:'=>'Akole:','supported tags are [username] and [userid]'=>'awọn afiṣe ti a ṣe atilẹyin ni [username] ati [userid]','Add Pages'=>'Fi Oju-iwe Kun','(select...)'=>'(yan...)','Role Usage edited.'=>'Iṣe Iṣẹ ti yipada.','These optional settings customize how PublishPress Permissions applies extra roles. Your existing WP Role Definitions can be applied in two different ways:'=>'Awọn eto aṣayan wọnyi ṣe akanṣe bi PublishPress Permissions ṣe nlo awọn ipa afikun. Awọn Itọkasi Ipa WP rẹ ti o wa tẹlẹ le ṣee lo ni awọn ọna meji oriṣiriṣi:','Pattern Roles convert \'post\' capabilities to the corresponding type-specific capability.  In a normal WP installation, this is the easiest solution.'=>'Awọn ipa Apẹẹrẹ yi awọn agbara \'ifiranṣẹ\' pada si agbara ti o baamu ti iru. Ni fifi sori WP ti o wọpọ, eyi ni ojutu ti o rọọrun julọ.','With Direct Assignment, capabilities are applied without modification.'=>'Pẹlu Iforukọsilẹ Taara, awọn agbara ni a lo laisi iyipada.','All Role Usage settings will be reset to DEFAULTS.  Are you sure?'=>'Gbogbo awọn eto Iṣe Iṣẹ yoo tun ṣeto si DEFAULTS.  Ṣe o dajudaju?','Role Usage updated.'=>'Iṣe Iṣẹ ti ni imudojuiwọn.','Role Usage: %s'=>'Iṣe Iṣẹ: %s','Usage'=>'Išẹ','no supplemental assignment'=>'ko si afikun iṣẹ','Pattern Role'=>'Ipa Àpẹẹrẹ','Direct Assignment'=>'Atọka Taara','Post Capabilities'=>'Awọn agbara Ifiweranṣẹ','Type-specific and/or status-specific equivalents of the following capabilities are included in supplemental %s roles:'=>'Awọn ibamu ti o ni pato iru ati/ tabi ipo ti awọn agbara atẹle ni a fi kun si awọn ipa afikun %s:','Arbitrary Capabilities'=>'Awọn Agbara Aifọwọyi','The following capabilities are included in supplemental %s roles:'=>'Awọn agbara ti o tẹle wa ninu awọn ipa afikun %s:','Role Capabilities'=>'Awọn Agbara Ipa','All capabilities defined for this WordPress role will be applied in supplemental assignments:'=>'Gbogbo awọn agbara ti a ṣe alaye fun ipa WordPress yii yoo ṣee lo ni awọn ipinnu afikun:','Notes regarding Pattern Roles'=>'Awọn akọsilẹ nipa Awọn Ipa Àpẹẹrẹ','Back to Role Usage List'=>'Pada si Atokọ Išẹ Ipa','Notes'=>'Awọn akọsilẹ','The \'posts\' capabilities in a WP role determine its function as a Pattern Role for supplemental assignment to Permission Groups. When you assign the \'Author\' pattern role for Pages, edit_posts and edit_published_posts become edit_pages and edit_published_pages.'=>'Awọn agbara \'ifiranṣẹ\' ninu ipa WP kan pinnu iṣẹ rẹ gẹgẹbi Ipa Apẹẹrẹ fun pinpin afikun si Awọn Ẹgbẹ Igbaniwọle. Nigbati o ba funni ni ipa apẹẹrẹ \'Onkọwe\' fun Awọn Oju-iwe, edit_posts ati edit_published_posts di edit_pages ati edit_published_pages.','Role capabilities defined for other post types (i.e. \'edit_others_pages\', \'edit_things\') are ignored unless Role Usage is set to Direct Assignment.'=>'Awọn agbara ipa ti a ṣe alaye fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ miiran (i.e. \'edit_others_pages\', \'edit_things\') ni a foju kọ ayafi ti Lilo Ipa ba ṣeto si Atunṣe Taara.','If one of the default roles is deleted from the WP database, it will remain available as a pattern role with default WP capabilities (but can be disabled here).'=>'Ti ọkan ninu awọn ipa aiyipada ba parẹ lati inu ibi ipamọ WP, yoo wa bi ipa àpẹẹrẹ pẹlu awọn agbara WP aiyipada (sugbon o le jẹ ki o ma ṣiṣẹ nibi).','No matching roles were found.'=>'Ko si awọn ipa ti o baamu ti a rii.','Media Library'=>'Ile-ikawe Media','Posts / Pages Listing'=>'Atokọ Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ / Awọn Ojúewé','List other users\' files if attached to a editable post'=>'Atokọ awọn faili awọn olumulo miiran ti o ba ti so pọ si ifiweranṣẹ ti o le ṣatunkọ','List other users\' files if attached to a viewable post'=>'Ṣàkóso àwọn fáìlì àwọn olumulo míì tí a bá so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọsílẹ̀ tó lè wo','List other users\' unattached files by default'=>'Ṣàkóso àwọn fáìlì àwọn olumulo míì tí kò ní so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọsílẹ̀ ní àkọ́kọ́','Edit other users\' files if attached to an editable post'=>'Ṣatúnṣe àwọn fáìlì àwọn olumulo míì tí a bá so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọsílẹ̀ tó jẹ́ pé a lè ṣatúnṣe','Prevent editing files if attached to a non-editable post'=>'Dènà ṣàtúnṣe àwọn fáìlì tí a bá so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọsílẹ̀ tó jẹ́ pé a kò lè ṣatúnṣe','Users can always edit their own files'=>'Àwọn olumulo lè máa ṣatúnṣe àwọn fáìlì tirẹ̀ nígbà gbogbo','Limited Editing Elements'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀lémẹ́ntì Ṣatúnṣe to Dín','Feature Moved'=>'Àmúyẹ̀ ti gbe lọ','The Limited Editing Elements feature has been moved to %1$sCapabilities > Editor Features > Element IDs%2$s for better organization and enhanced functionality.'=>'Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Awọn eroja Iwọn Iwọn ti ni gbigbe si %1$sAgbara > Awọn ẹya ẹrọ > ID Ero%2$s fun iṣeto to dara ati iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti o pọ si.','The Limited Editing Elements feature has been moved to the PublishPress Capabilities plugin. Please install %1$sPublishPress Capabilities%2$s to access this functionality.'=>'Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Awọn eroja Iwọn